"Enyl-tirg is a craftswoman in Root, a village of the Rapport, who makes learning cushions."
"She is an unimpressive wizard but a votary devoted to cushions and thread enchantment."
"The Primary takes his children to her for their first learning cushions."
"She made the leather learning cushion Stuart gave Alden Thorn."
"Her two children have just begun at the Rapport school."
